 pact Fund and member generosity. This evening honors the organizations enr
 iching our community through creativity\, expression\, and cultural engage
 ment - nurturing access\, inspiration\, and opportunity for all. Connect w
 ith these visionary leaders during the reception and learn more about the 
 impact of their philanthropic initiatives.\n\nOur esteemed recipients incl
 ude: ARCK\, Boston Gay Men’s Chorus\, Boston Lyric Opera\, Calling All C
 rows\, Commonwealth Shakespeare Company\, Community Art Center\, Conservat
 ory Lab Charter School\, Cultural Equity Incubator\, Esplanade Association
