SUMMARY:Member Mixer: Passport to Conversation
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are Confirmed\
 nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/179731\n\nBoard Quinta
 nsa Flight 217 and take off for an evening of travel-inspired conversation
