SUMMARY:Watch Party: Kentucky Derby
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avail
 able\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180914\n\nWhat’
 s better than cheering on your horse with a Mint Julep in hand? Doing it f
 rom the comfort of The Pub—soaking up all the Derby Day buzz and countin
 g down to the 6:57PM post time without missing a moment of the action.\n\n
 We’re bringing Churchill Downs to the ‘House with a Derby celebration 
 featuring classic Mint Juleps\, and inspired cocktails - the Royal Julep\,
  and Derby Flower. In addition enjoy an à la carte Derby-inspired menu of
  bites by the chef. Members are encouraged to wear daytime cocktail attire
 . Hats are optional—however highly encouraged. \n\n*Menu specials begin 
 at 4:00PM. Reservations are not required\, however recommended. Following 
 our usual policy\, members are allowed to bring up to three guests to this
  occasion. \n\nMake a Reservation.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180914
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
