DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 10 spots lef
 t\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/1
 76007\n\nStart your week in good company with the Café Q Community dinner
  table for members-only. Set aside for those looking to expand their socia
 l circle over a shared meal\, this gathering is all about good food\, live
 ly conversation\, and meaningful connections. Pull up a chair\, and savor 
 the experience—because nothing brings people together quite like a great
  meal.\n\n*This event is reserved for members only. An advance charge of $
 24 per member contributes to communal appetizers available upon seating. M
 embers are responsible for à la carte entrées\, desserts\, and beverages
 \, plus taxes and fees. Cancellations made within 24 hours of the event\, 
 or failure to attend will be subject to the Café Q's surcharge policy.
