SUMMARY:Hands-On Impact: Household Goods
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 30 sp
 ots left\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/
 events/182103\n\nA simple set of kitchen tools can be the difference betwe
 en a space and a home.\n\nJoin The ‘Quin Impact Fund for a hands-on volu
 nteer experience in partnership with Household Goods\, where you will asse
 mble Kitchen Starter Sets for individuals and families transitioning into 
 stable housing. Together\, you will unpack\, sort\, and thoughtfully build
  essential kits - each one filled with everyday items that make it possibl
 e to cook\, gather\, and begin again.\n\nHousehold Goods furnishes more th
 an 2\,500 homes each year\, yet the demand for basic kitchen essentials re
 mains constant. These starter sets - simple\, practical\, and deeply impac
 tful - help ensure that every home begins with the tools needed for daily 
 life.\n\nMembers are invited to contribute by donating new or gently used 
 kitchen items or supporting purchases through a curated Amazon wish list a
 head of the event. A meaningful opportunity to give back\, connect\, and p
 lay a small part in helping someone build a home from the ground up.\n\n*T
 his event is complimentary and reserved for members only. For any questio
 ns regarding donation items\, please contact The ‘Quin Impact Fund team 
 at impact@thequin.com.\n\nShop the Amazon Wishlist here.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182103
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
